                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> Any ideas?\n\nInstead of `noremap = true` use `remap = true`, because you'd actually want to use meaning of the keys as they are mapped and not as they are coming from default mappings.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Any ideas?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">noremap = true</code> use <code class=\"notranslate\">remap = true</code>, because you'd actually want to use meaning of the keys as they are mapped and not as they are coming from default mappings.</p>",
